skar Fevras\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\">Oskar Fevras</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Inside the strongbox on the wall <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-272&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-57</span> on the first floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a>, only if <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/38px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/50px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oskar Fevras\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\">Oskar Fevras</a> was not freed during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Note to self - do not forget that the painting is in the attic. THE painting. THAT one.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This note appears to be placed in the safe in error, as Lady Jannath's estate is not haunted if Oskar is not freed.</li>\n<li>Prior to Patch 8, the name of this item was spelled \"Fervas\" rather than \"Fevras\".</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1651/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18543/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4687/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 881568/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.895      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   34.895      1 -total\n 41.35%   14.429      7 Template:Icon_text\n 32.14%   11.217     15 Template:Trim\n 21.29%    7.430      3 Template:Icon_link\n 19.33%    6.745      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.74%    4.794      1 Template:Notes\n 13.55%    4.727      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.43%    4.687      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.06%    4.558      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35703-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203000 and revision id 366162. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}